Fri Feb 13 15:15:18 UTC 2026 - Dominique Leuenberger <dimstar@opensuse.org>

- Update to version 50.alpha:
  + Application renamed from app.devsuite.Manuals to
    org.gnome.Manuals
  + Add mouse navigation support (back/forward with mouse
    keys 8 and 9)
  + Improve navigation state updates when using history
    back/forward
  + Make Ctrl+K focus search and select all text for easier
    re-searching
  + Bundle dialog improvements:
    - Use collate key for filename sorting
    - Add button to show/hide legacy SDKs
    - Denote EOL SDKs and show warnings
  + Build system improvements
  + Updated translations.

